#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Setting up your POS system is a breeze. Simply navigate to the <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">POS</font></strong> app, configure your cash "
"register, and customize your product listings. The system supports various "
"payment methods,\n"
"            making it convenient for your customers to complete their "
"purchases. Plus, you can generate detailed sales reports to keep track of "
"your daily, weekly, and monthly performance."
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan sistem POS Anda itu sangat mudah. Cukup buka aplikasi "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">POS</font></strong>, konfigurasikan "
"mesin kas Anda, dan kustomisasikan daftar produk Anda. Sistem mendukung "
"beragam metode pembayaran,\n"
"            sehingga mudah bagi pelanggan Anda untuk menyelesaikan pembelian "
"mereka. Ditambah lagi, Anda dapat membuat laporan sales yang rinci untuk "
"terus melacak performa harian, mingguan, dan bulanan Anda."

#. module: fitness
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:fitness.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Setting up your online store is as easy as customizing a few settings. Go to "
"the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Website</font></strong> app, "
"choose your theme, and start adding your products. You can offer various "
"payment\n"
"            options, manage shipping methods, and even set up automated "
"marketing campaigns to boost your sales. With real-time inventory updates, "
"your customers will always know what's available, enhancing their shopping "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan toko online Anda semudah mengustomisasi beberapa pengaturan. Buka "
"aplikasi <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Website</font></strong>, "
"pilih tema Anda, dan mulai tambahkan produk Anda. Anda juga dapat menawarkan "
"beragam opsi\n"
"            pembayaran, mengelola metode pengiriman, dan bahkan menyiapkan "
"kampanye marketing otomatis untuk mendorong sales Anda. Dengan update "
"inventaris real-time, pelanggan Anda akan selalu mengetahui apa yang "
"tersedia, meningkatkan pengalaman belanja mereka."

